  1:Name            D4_STATB Bus controller state machine logic;
  2:PartNo          108219-001;
  3:Revision        13;
  4:Date            28/3/26;
  5:Designer        Dave Henry;
  6:Company         Breadboarding Labs;
  7:Location        None;
  8:Assembly        None;
  9:Device          p22v10;
 10:
 11:/* 03/02/2026 V1 Initial version converted from PALASM format in COMPAQ design doc         */
 12:/*                                                                                         */
 13:/*******************************************************************************************/
 14:/*                                                                                         */
 15:/*******************************************************************************************/
 16:/*
 17:DESCRIPTION
 18:This PAL implements some of the bus controller state machine logic.
 19:REV B adjusts the sampling time of the IO16* line by adding state Tl0 to the 
 20:startup of T41. If the CX16* (IO16) line comes in after T00 then we shift 
 21:to T41 instead of T40. REV B also tightens up the response from ADS* to ALE by 
 22:one clock by shifting directly to ALE from MYCYC during the initial bus 
 23:transaction. State TSO is still used between transactions.
 24:*/
 25:
 26:/* Pin Map 
 27:         --------
 28:CLK16   |1     24| Vcc
 29:/MYCYC  |2     23| /RST
 30:/CLAST  |3     22| /ALE
 31:/CX16   |4     21| CK8
 32:LMIO    |5     20| /T41
 33:/LNOWS  |6     19| /T40
 34:/BWAIT  |7     18| /WDEN
 35:/M16    |8     17| /CMD
 36:T00     |9     16| /TS0
 37:T01     |10    15| /BRDY
 38:T10     |11    14| T31
 39:Gnd     |12    13| /OE
 40:         --------
 41:*/
 42:
 43:/*******************************************************************************************/
 44:
 45:/* Inputs Note GAL20V10 Pin 23 and 14 are also inputs. Only Pins 15-22 can be Outputs */
 46:Pin  1 = CLK16;
 47:Pin  2 = !MYCYC;
 48:Pin  3 = !CLAST;
 49:Pin  4 = !CX16;
 50:Pin  5 = LMIO;
 51:Pin  6 = !LNOWS;
 52:Pin  7 = !BWAIT;
 53:Pin  8 = !M16;

LISTING FOR LOGIC DESCRIPTION FILE: D4-STATB.pld                     Page 2

